  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MilvusOASIS v2.0.3\n\nMilvus OASIS Provider - open-source vector database for OASIS holons and avatars via Milvus REST API v2. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Add bounded Strong-consistency Milvus CQL query execution and controls (793aead)\n- Integrate verified Milvus native storage (87dd2da)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Require Milvus native upsert acknowledgement before publishing saved state (b11b611)\n- Validate Milvus explicit schema and Strong collection admission (1730439)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MilvusOASIS",
